      "writtenOn": "2019-04-08T04:32:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done: changed config_networkDefaultCaptivePortalServerUrl to config_networkCaptivePortalServerUrl and set as empty, and moved the default to a constant in this class, to reduce OEM confusion (the NetworkStack can control which resource is overrideable via overlayable.xml, but the framework can\u0027t, so having only the config hook in resources might be less confusing).",
